  "cause": {
   "kind": "regression",
   "source": "line-status-before-first-run",
   "text": "The owner asked for a repeating notice (check a named source on a schedule and tell them) without giving the source's address. The worker looked for the source, asked the owner for the address, and ended the turn without scheduling any reminder or preparation, so the agreed request had nothing standing behind it and a later status question could only report that nothing was set. The current tool description already says to schedule a safe preparation in this case, and the worker did not follow it.\n"
  },
